                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I won this game and I feel bad because I don't even want to play it.  I quite enjoy platformer games and I use a Xbox controller to play them on my pc.  This game has an odd key set up I found the shoot button the Xbox it is the right shoulder button.  Makes no sense but at least I found it.  There is also a serious issue with the controller not letting you shoot to the left.  Your character really doens't want to face that direction.\n\nI did try the game without the controller  but the keyboard movement isn't for me.  If this game didn't even have controller support I could at least use a program to rebind my Xbox key to simulate the keyboard controls so it would be more playable.  Sadly, with it recognizing the Xbox controller that is impossible.  I wouldn't recommend this game and there is a way to exit the game without pressing alt-f4.\n\nSo I managed to play a bit futher into the game and I got stuck so I had to quit.\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=911150135",
